<template>
  <div class="news-page">
    <header class="site-header"><div class="header-inner"><button class="brand" @click="router.push('/')">GAMEBOI</button><nav><button class="nav-link active">资讯</button><button class="nav-link" @click="router.push('/favorites')">收藏</button><button v-if="isLogin" class="nav-link" @click="router.push('/user')">我的</button><button v-else class="nav-link" @click="router.push('/login')">登录</button></nav><button class="profile-link" @click="router.push('/user')">账户 <span>↗</span></button></div></header>
    <main class="home-shell"><section class="home-intro"><p>GAMEBOI / FPS NEWSROOM</p><h1>FPS 游戏资讯<br>与赛事前线。</h1><span>精选官方公告、版本动向、活动和赛事资讯</span></section>
      <div v-if="categoryStore.error" class="games-error" role="alert">游戏列表加载失败：{{ categoryStore.error }} <button :disabled="categoryStore.loading" @click="categoryStore.fetchCategories(true)">重试</button></div>
